  "intro": "Solve each linear equation or inequality for the variable. Use inverse operations, distribute and combine like terms when needed, clear fractions by the LCD, and flip the inequality sign whenever you multiply or divide both sides by a negative number. Watch for special cases (no solution or infinitely many solutions) and for literal equations where coefficients are letters.",
  "items": [
